# This folder has two parts.
#
# 1. The shared AIOS: every file that came with the AIOS repository. git tracks them, and
#    "update the AIOS" brings their newest version. Do not edit them.
# 2. Your own part: everything you and Claude create here. git ignores ALL of it, so it is
#    never shared with anyone and an update never changes it. For example:
.env
.env.local
aios.json
.mcp.json
context/
knowledge/
tasks/
active/
projects/
private/
.tmp/
.claude/settings.local.json
# ...and your own skills, agents, scripts, directives and migrations: anything that did not
# come with the repository.
*
